# Paths this repository declares to the violation audit, each with its reason.
#
# This repository is a fork of Apple's mlx-swift, kept mergeable with
# upstream. Every directory below holds upstream's files: the Swift API
# (Source/MLX*, Source/Examples), the vendored C and C++ sources it bundles
# (Source/Cmlx: MLX itself, fmt, nlohmann/json, googletest, the Metal
# headers), upstream's tests, its build helpers and its Xcode project, and a
# repository root whose contents Swift Package Manager and CMake decide.
#
# Our own work here is patches on top, and a patch has to land on upstream's
# file. Re-laying out a 1599-line upstream file into modules would turn every
# later upstream change into a conflict, which costs more than the limit was
# ever meant to save. The limits exist for source a person here edits and
# navigates; when we write something of our own in this repository it goes in
# a directory of ours and is not listed below.
Source/
Tests/
tools/
cmake/
xcode/
Package.swift
.
